Racine.ai modified the base model: it removed 12 of the 24 decoder layers,
added a sentence readout head, and fine-tuned the result. The files in
models/jevol-web/ are an ONNX export of this model for the browser
(int8 decoder, fp16 vision, int8 token embeddings).

